changes.why:
The decisive numbers for whether a twin reproduces the rig's mode:
- ring slide: rig 0.17-0.26 cm/deg, twin cd060 0.04;
- dz: rig 0.15-0.18 cm/deg, twin 0.37;
- c_u sign: rig ema < 0, slope > 0, twin > 0.
M1 alone cannot tell the two modes apart.

