configs_and_runs.what:
Throttle +35 ms, attitude +0, ring and carrier body rates on the rig's EMA. Compared with the rig on four things:
- f0 1.25-1.5 Hz;
- ema M1 >= 1 deg and slope <= 0.5x;
- the rig's mode shape (ring slide >= 0.15 cm/deg of see-saw, dz <= 0.25 cm/deg);
