Neighbours: rt_norate isolates the body-rate EMA; rt050 brackets the throttle delay.
Falsifier for 'the twin reproduces the rig': ema stays calm (M1 < 1 deg), or the shape stays vertical (slide < 0.1 cm/deg) in both repeats. Then round C is next.

Each against its no-fix arm, 2 runs, bars in the card first:
- D1 slope (exists);
